OL,3,AI climbed the career ladder and got my
OL,4,Adream job at 30 - then I hit burnout
OL,5,
OL,6,FJo Hooper spent her 20s trying to climb
OL,7,Fthe career ladder, quickly rising
OL,8,Fthrough the ranks with promotions and
OL,9,Fpay rises.
OL,11,F"I loved being good at it," said Jo, a
OL,12,Fformer communications professional.
OL,14,FBut just after she landed her dream
OL,15,Frole at 30, Jo struggled with burnout
OL,16,Fand had to take time off work.
OL,18,FBurnout is recognised by the World
OL,19,FHealth Organization (WHO) as a state of
OL,20,Fphysical and emotional exhaustion.
